### =========================================================
### SERVICE MASTER — REST Client Test File
### Service Data Master (Beasiswa & Persyaratan)
### Diakses lewat API Gateway (thin-proxy, tanpa validasi token —
### service ini melakukan verifikasi JWT sendiri)
### =========================================================

# @gatewayUrl : base URL gateway (ganti sesuai gateway kamu)
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
# @token : access token dari service-rbac (login sebagai Admin)
@token = ISI_ACCESS_TOKEN_SETELAH_LOGIN

### -------------------------------------------------------
### HEALTH CHECK
### -------------------------------------------------------

### Cek service hidup (health pada service langsung, bukan di gateway)
GET http://localhost:5002/health


### =========================================================
### BEASISWA — Endpoint Publik
### =========================================================

### List beasiswa aktif (statusAktif=true & tanggalTutup >= hari ini)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa?page=1&limit=10


### List beasiswa aktif dengan filter search (contains/nama)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa?search=Prestasi&page=1&limit=10


### Detail beasiswa + daftar persyaratan (publik)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa/1


### Detail beasiswa yang tidak aktif/sudah tutup (harus 404 generik)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa/3


### =========================================================
### BEASISWA — Admin only (authenticate + authorize('admin'))
### =========================================================

### List SEMUA beasiswa termasuk nonaktif/sudah lewat (panel admin)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa/all?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Create beasiswa baru (kuota > 0, tanggalTutup > tanggalBuka)
# @name createBeasiswa
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Beasiswa Talenta Digital 2026",
  "deskripsi": "Beasiswa pelatihan coding untuk talenta muda Indonesia.",
  "kuota": 30,
  "tanggalBuka": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "tanggalTutup": "2026-12-31T23:59:59.000Z"
}


### Test validasi: kuota 0 (harus 400, bukan 500)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Kuarto Zero",
  "deskripsi": "Test validasi kuota.",
  "kuota": 0,
  "tanggalBuka": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "tanggalTutup": "2026-12-31T23:59:59.000Z"
}


### Test validasi: tanggalTutup sebelum tanggalBuka (harus 400)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Tanggal Terbalik",
  "deskripsi": "Test validasi tanggal.",
  "kuota": 10,
  "tanggalBuka": "2026-12-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "tanggalTutup": "2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}


### Update beasiswa (semua field optional, tanggal diisi bersamaan)
# @id = createBeasiswa id dari response di atas
PUT {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Beasiswa Talenta Digital 2026 Updated",
  "kuota": 40
}


### SOFT DELETE: nonaktifkan beasiswa (statusAktif=false, baris tetap ada)
DELETE {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Test proteksi publik: akses DELETE tanpa token (harus 401)
DELETE {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa/1


### =========================================================
### PERSYARATAN — Endpoint Publik
### =========================================================

### List persyaratan milik beasiswa tertentu (dipakai wizard aplikasi)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/master/persyaratan/beasiswa/1/persyaratan


### List persyaratan beasiswa yang tidak ada (harus 404)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/master/persyaratan/beasiswa/999/persyaratan


### =========================================================
### PERSYARATAN — Admin only
### =========================================================

### Create persyaratan baru (beasiswaId harus exist — kalau tidak, 404 bukan FK error)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/master/persyaratan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beasiswaId": 1,
  "namaDokumen": "Surat Pernyataan Kesanggupan",
  "wajib": true
}


### Create persyaratan untuk beasiswa yang tidak ada (harus 404, bukan raw FK error)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/master/persyaratan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beasiswaId": 999,
  "namaDokumen": "Dokumen Tidak Valid",
  "wajib": true
}


### Update persyaratan (ubah wajib / nama dokumen)
PUT {{gatewayUrl}}/master/persyaratan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "namaDokumen": "KTP yang Diperbarui",
  "wajib": true
}


### HARD DELETE: hapus persyaratan permanen
DELETE {{gatewayUrl}}/master/persyaratan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Test proteksi role: coba akses admin pakai token applicant (harus 403)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/master/beasiswa/all
Authorization: Bearer ISI_TOKEN_APPLICANT_DISINI